        "content": "## ClawQL IDP Observability ([#252](https://github.com/danielsmithdevelopment/ClawQL/issues/252))\n\n**Prometheus** scrapes **`GET /metrics`** on **clawql-mcp-http**. Pair with **Langfuse** (BYO) for LLM spans and **Tempo/Jaeger** for OTLP traces — see [`docs/observability/README.md`](https://github.com/danielsmithdevelopment/ClawQL/blob/main/docs/observability/README.md).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
